#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Account Creation\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"account-creation\">アカウント作成</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Atmospheric apps should generally implement an account creation flow of their own — e.g., \"Log in or sign up.\" They may or may not run their own [PDS](/guides/the-at-stack#pds) as a default home for new accounts. Once a user has created an account on any PDS, including a Bluesky PDS, they can log in to any atproto app using that account. This works via [DID resolution](/guides/the-at-stack#did-plc), which allows apps to find the PDS that's hosting a given account and trigger the [auth flow](/guides/permission-requests) on that PDS.\n"
msgstr "Atmosphericアプリは、なるべく「Log in or sign up」のような独自のアカウント作成フローを実装するべきです。新しいアカウントのホームとして独自の[PDS](/guides/the-at-stack#pds)を運用する場合もあれば、そうでない場合もあります。Bluesky PDSを含む、いずれかのPDSでユーザーがアカウントを作成すると、そのアカウントを使用してどのatprotoアプリにもログインできるようになります。これは[DID解決](/guides/the-at-stack#did-plc)を通じて動作し、アプリが対象アカウントをホストしているPDSを見つけて、そのPDS上で[認証フロー](/guides/permission-requests)を開始できるようにします。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Account Management\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"account-management\">アカウント管理</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have an account, you can manage it via the host PDS. Our [reference PDS](https://github.com/bluesky-social/pds) includes a basic account management interface that is accessible at `https://pds.example.com/account`. From this interface, you can:\n"
msgstr "アカウントを作った後は、ホストPDSを通じて管理できます。私たちの[リファレンスPDS](https://github.com/bluesky-social/pds)には、`https://pds.example.com/account`からアクセスできる基本的なアカウント管理インターフェースが含まれています。このインターフェースから、次の操作ができます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "- See a list of devices that are currently logged in to your account, and log out of any of them:\n"
msgstr "- 現在アカウントにログインしているデバイスを一覧し、その中から選んでログアウトできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={devices} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={devices} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "- See a list of apps that have permission to access your account, and revoke any of those permissions:\n"
msgstr "- アカウントにアクセスする権限を持つアプリを一覧し、権限を取り消すことができます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={apps} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={apps} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "- Change your password:\n"
msgstr "- パスワードを変更できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={password} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" /> \n"
"</Container>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={password} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" /> \n"
"</Container>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "- Change the email address associated with your account:\n"
msgstr "- アカウントに関連付けられたメールアドレスを変更できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={email} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={email} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also perform some account actions — including on PDSes that do not implement this interface — using `goat`, our CLI tool.\n"
msgstr "このインターフェースを実装していないPDSでも、一部のアカウント操作はCLIツール`goat`を使って実行できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"$ goat account\n"
"NAME:\n"
"   goat account - commands for auth session and account management\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"$ goat account\n"
"NAME:\n"
"   goat account - commands for auth session and account management\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"USAGE:\n"
"   goat account [command [command options]]\n"
msgstr ""
"USAGE:\n"
"   goat account [command [command options]]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/account-management/en.mdx:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"COMMANDS:\n"
"   login                 create session with PDS instance\n"
"   logout                delete any current session\n"
"   activate              (re)activate current account\n"
"   deactivate            deactivate current account\n"
"   status                show basic account hosting status for any account\n"
"   update-handle         change handle for current account\n"
"   check-auth            check session auth and current account status\n"
"   missing-blobs         list any missing blobs for current account\n"
"   service-auth          ask the PDS to create a service auth token\n"
"   service-auth-offline  create service auth token via locally-held signing key\n"
"   create                create a new account on the indicated PDS host\n"
"   migrate               move account to a new PDS. requires full auth (not app password)\n"
"   plc                   commands for managing PLC identity (DID) via PDS host\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"COMMANDS:\n"
"   login                 create session with PDS instance\n"
"   logout                delete any current session\n"
"   activate              (re)activate current account\n"
"   deactivate            deactivate current account\n"
"   status                show basic account hosting status for any account\n"
"   update-handle         change handle for current account\n"
"   check-auth            check session auth and current account status\n"
"   missing-blobs         list any missing blobs for current account\n"
"   service-auth          ask the PDS to create a service auth token\n"
"   service-auth-offline  create service auth token via locally-held signing key\n"
"   create                create a new account on the indicated PDS host\n"
"   migrate               move account to a new PDS. requires full auth (not app password)\n"
"   plc                   commands for managing PLC identity (DID) via PDS host\n"
"```\n"

